msgid "**Addon state is a variant axis.** Optional addons (`required: false`) MUST express their enabled/disabled split through the role's [`meta/variants.yml`](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) so CI matrix runs exercise both states, mirroring requirement 050's MCP variant axis. Required addons (`required: true`) are not a variant axis because they are always installed."
