msgid "**Administrator Role Mapping:** Members of the ``administrator`` role group are Nextcloud administrators. With LDAP, ``user_ldap`` reads the role group as its admin group at runtime and a change reaches Nextcloud within ``NEXTCLOUD_LDAP_CACHE_TTL`` seconds; with ``sociallogin``, the groups claim maps to the ``admin`` group at every login; with ``oidc_login`` outside the LDAP proxy mode, the ``is_admin`` attribute reads the groups claim."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Administrator Role Mapping:** Members of the `administrator` role group are Nextcloud administrators. With LDAP, `user_ldap` reads the role group as its admin group at runtime and a change reaches Nextcloud within `NEXTCLOUD_LDAP_CACHE_TTL` seconds; with `sociallogin`, the groups claim maps to the `admin` group at every login; with `oidc_login` outside the LDAP proxy mode, the `is_admin` attribute reads the groups claim."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Administrator group:** The group ``web-app-proxmox-administrator`` holds the ``Administrator`` role on ``/``, propagated. Proxmox VE accepts only ``[A-Za-z0-9._-]`` in an OpenID group claim, so the role cannot map the full-path RBAC claim; instead the RBAC sync (``tasks/utils/rbac/sync.yml``) adds every member of the Keycloak administrator group to it, at deploy and on its timer, and removes every other account from it."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Administrator group:** The group `web-app-proxmox-administrator` holds the `Administrator` role on `/`, propagated. Proxmox VE accepts only `[A-Za-z0-9._-]` in an OpenID group claim, so the role cannot map the full-path RBAC claim; instead the RBAC sync (`tasks/utils/rbac/sync.yml`) adds every member of the Keycloak administrator group to it, at deploy and on its timer, and removes every other account from it."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Administrator login is enforced to be key-based:** playbooks fail early if users.administrator.authorized_keys is empty."
msgstr "**Входът на администратор се налага да бъде базиран на ключ:** playbooks не успеят рано, ако users.administrator.authorized_keys е празна."

msgid "**Administrator reconcile:** [reconcile_admins.rb](./files/ruby/reconcile_admins.rb) grants OpenProject administrator rights to the members of the `administrator` role group, provisions those that have no account yet from LDAP, and revokes the rights from every other account except the platform administrator and the GitLab bot. It runs as a container hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/) at every deploy and on its timer, so a group change in Keycloak or LDAP reaches `User.admin` within one timer interval."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Administrator reconcile:** `reconcile_admins.rb <./files/ruby/reconcile_admins.rb>`__ grants OpenProject administrator rights to the members of the ``administrator`` role group, provisions those that have no account yet from LDAP, and revokes the rights from every other account except the platform administrator and the GitLab bot. It runs as a container hook of `sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync <../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/>`__ at every deploy and on its timer, so a group change in Keycloak or LDAP reaches ``User.admin`` within one timer interval."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Administrator role from the IdP:** every realm user may sign in; members of the ``administrator`` RBAC group of ``web-app-jellyfin`` get the Jellyfin administrator flag. The SSO plugin reads it from the ``groups`` claim, the LDAP plugin from the ``memberOf`` entry of the group, and both remove the flag at the next login of a user who left the group."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Administrator role from the IdP:** every realm user may sign in; members of the `administrator` RBAC group of `web-app-jellyfin` get the Jellyfin administrator flag. The SSO plugin reads it from the `groups` claim, the LDAP plugin from the `memberOf` entry of the group, and both remove the flag at the next login of a user who left the group."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Administrator role:** [files/ruby/greenlight/reconcile_roles.rb](./files/ruby/greenlight/reconcile_roles.rb) sets the Greenlight `Administrator` role from the `web-app-bigbluebutton` `administrator` members, matched by email, and demotes every other Greenlight administrator to `User`, as an RBAC hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/) at every deploy and on its timer. The platform administrator keeps the role."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Administrator role:** `files/ruby/greenlight/reconcile_roles.rb <./files/ruby/greenlight/reconcile_roles.rb>`__ sets the Greenlight ``Administrator`` role from the ``web-app-bigbluebutton`` ``administrator`` members, matched by email, and demotes every other Greenlight administrator to ``User``, as an RBAC hook of `sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync <../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/>`__ at every deploy and on its timer. The platform administrator keeps the role."
