msgid "**App-control SSH path:** Each template runs `app-control.sh stop|start <application_id>|all` in the runner, which signs in over SSH as the host account `app-control` with the `app_control_ssh_key` credential and a pinned host key. The `authorized_keys` entry of that account is `restrict`ed to a forced command that accepts only `app-control stop|start <application_id>|all`, and sudo lets the account run exactly those two subcommands as root."
