msgid "**Break-Glass:** With SSO on the database login is closed, so the break-glass path is the CLI: `mobilizon rpc` in the container, the way [files/python/rbac_sync.py](./files/python/rbac_sync.py) runs [files/elixir/rbac.exs](./files/elixir/rbac.exs), manages accounts and roles."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Break-Glass:** With SSO on, PluggableAuth keeps no local password form, so the break-glass path is the CLI: ``maintenance/run.php createAndPromote`` and ``changePassword`` in the MediaWiki container, which ``tasks/04_admin.yml`` already runs for the administrator."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Break-Glass:** With SSO on, PluggableAuth keeps no local password form, so the break-glass path is the CLI: `maintenance/run.php createAndPromote` and `changePassword` in the MediaWiki container, which `tasks/04_admin.yml` already runs for the administrator."
