msgid "**Profile sync:** Every OIDC login rewrites first name, last name, email, phone, locale, time zone and website of the XWiki profile from the ``profile``, ``email`` and ``phone`` claims, and composes the address field from the ``street_address``, ``postal_code``, ``locality`` and ``country`` members of the ``address`` claim through ``oidc.user.mapping`` (one line for the street, one for postal code and locality, one for the country; an absent member stays empty); an LDAP login maps names, email, phone, website and organisation."
