# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Protected by this:** `git commit*`, `docker run*`, `docker build*`, `docker push*`, `docker login*`, every mutating `gh` verb, and every non-GET `gh api` call. Each would be destructive or externally visible if executed without review."
msgstr "**Защитен от това:** `git commit*`, `docker run*`, `docker build*`, `docker push*`, `docker login*`, всяка мутация `gh` глагол, и всеки не-GET `gh api` Плащам. Всеки би бил разрушителен или външно видим, ако бъде екзекутиран без преглед."

msgid "**Provider indirection:** Consumers reference ``web-app-email`` instead of a concrete mail server, so the provider changes without touching any consumer."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Provider indirection:** Consumers reference `web-app-email` instead of a concrete mail server, so the provider changes without touching any consumer."
