msgid "**Provider-Synced Profile:** Every OIDC sign-in syncs the full name and the email from Keycloak, and GitLab shows both read-only."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Provisioning:** The instance requests accounts for its agents under the developer's own login, which becomes the agents' owner; the request is an ask the developer or the live owner approves, and only then does the provisioner create the accounts. Account names come from `utils.agents.naming`, the default account from `utils.agents.accounts`, and the credential-release policy from `utils.agents.keepass`."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Provisioning:** The instance requests accounts for its agents under the developer’s own login, which becomes the agents’ owner; the request is an ask the developer or the live owner approves, and only then does the provisioner create the accounts. Account names come from ``utils.agents.naming``, the default account from ``utils.agents.accounts``, and the credential-release policy from ``utils.agents.keepass``."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Proxy Scheme:** Matomo reads the scheme from `X-Forwarded-Proto`, so it builds `https` URLs behind the TLS-terminating proxy."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Proxy Scheme:** Matomo reads the scheme from ``X-Forwarded-Proto``, so it builds ``https`` URLs behind the TLS-terminating proxy."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Proxy-aware:** Exposes HTTP on localhost, picked up by front proxy role."
msgstr "**Прокси- софтуер:** Показва HTTP на локален хост, прихванат от предната прокси роля."

msgid "**Proxy-owned secret header:** the vhost sends a header named ``x-infinito-sso-proxy-<sso_proxy_secret>`` with every request, and ``gateway.auth.trustedProxy.requiredHeaders`` lists it next to ``x-forwarded-user``. A client that reaches the gateway port directly, including a process on the host that connects to the published port, cannot name that header, so the gateway answers its forged identity headers with 401. The gateway sends no failure reason to the client. ``files/test/test.sh`` asserts the refusal on the published port."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Proxy-owned secret header:** the vhost sends a header named `x-infinito-sso-proxy-<sso_proxy_secret>` with every request, and `gateway.auth.trustedProxy.requiredHeaders` lists it next to `x-forwarded-user`. A client that reaches the gateway port directly, including a process on the host that connects to the published port, cannot name that header, so the gateway answers its forged identity headers with 401. The gateway sends no failure reason to the client. `files/test/test.sh` asserts the refusal on the published port."
msgstr ""

