# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A logographic target needs its own ratio: one character carries a whole morpheme, so a complete rendering runs at a third of the source's length and the flat ratio reads it as a dropped clause. Measured against the live engine, 36 of 45 complete zh/ja/ko passages tripped it, 44 of those 45 ending in terminal punctuation; the shortest was 0.28."
msgstr "Логографската цел се нуждае от собствено съотношение: един герой носи цяла морфема, така че пълна рендиране работи на една трета от дължината на източника и равното съотношение го чете като отпаднала клауза. Измерен спрямо двигателя на живо, 36 на 45 пълен zh/ja/ko проходите го спънаха. 44 от тези 45 завършва с крайна пунктуация; най-късата е 0.28."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A long-running worker (own image, gated on both endpoints present) that:"
msgstr "Дълготраен работник (собствено изображение, прикачено към двете крайни точки) че:"

msgid "A mail through ``sys-svc-mail`` to the account's platform mailbox."
msgstr ""

msgid "A mailbox realm cannot return to `external`; `kc_email_policy_change` refuses it. Build the reverse switch only when an operator needs it."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A malformed filter expression."
msgstr "Неправилен филтърен израз."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A manager-pinned role keeps its volumes node-local (``swarm_nfs_backed``) and its DB sidecar carries the matching placement constraint, so a literal ``shared: false`` there is honoured instead of overridden — Magento hard-fails ``setup:install`` on the central MariaDB major."
msgstr "Роля на мениджъра запазва своя обем възел местно (``swarm_nfs_backed``) и неговият DB страничен вагон носи същото ограничение за поставяне, така че буквален ``shared: false`` има чест, вместо да пренаселено Magento твърди повреди ``setup:install`` в центъра MariaDB Майоре."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A mapping deep-merges, so naming one key changes that key and nothing else. ``null`` empties the topic, which is the only way to say \"bring nothing\": merged, an empty mapping is a no-op and would leave exactly the services the round was trying to shed."
msgstr "Картиране на дълбоките сливания, така че да се назове един ключ променя този ключ и нищо друго. ``null`` Изпразни темата, което е единственият начин да се каже \"Не носи нищо.\": Слято, празното картографиране е неоперативна и ще остави точно услугите, които кръгът се опитва да хвърли."

msgid "A mapping key in ``meta/services.yml`` that carries ``# nocheck: inventory-open-subtree <reason>`` on its own line, or on the comment line directly above it, lets the inventory set any child key under it. A marker without a reason opens nothing."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A mapping of docker volume names and database names to ``postgres`` or ``mariadb``. Both volume spellings are emitted per application, because which one a host used depends on ``shared``, which is inventory-dependent and therefore unknowable from a checkout - and both spellings resolve to the same engine anyway."
msgstr "Картиране на имената на докерите и имената на базите данни ``postgres`` или ``mariadb``. И двата обема правопис се излъчват по заявление, тъй като единият използван гостоприемник зависи от ``shared``, която е зависима от инвентара и следователно не може да се знае от касата - и двата правописа решават на един и същ двигател така или иначе."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A mapping of the shape::"
msgstr "Картиране на формата:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "A mapping of the shape::      {\"logo\": <absolute path> | False, \"title\": <str> | False,      \"name\": <README H1>, \"label\": <title, else name>,      \"bootstrap\": <bool>,      \"slots\": {name: {\"width\", \"height\", \"text_only\", \"frame\"}}}  ``label`` serves installers that require a site name even when the title replacement is disabled. ``bootstrap`` tells whether the role links the shared Bootstrap component mapping. A slot with ``frame`` set is shown on brand-colored chrome, so its text takes the frame text color."
msgstr "Картиране на формата: {\"logo\": <absolute paint>   год. \"title\": <str> - Не. \"name\": <README H1>, \"label\": <title, друго име >, \"bootstrap\": <bool>, \"slots\": {име: {\"width\", \"height\", \"text_only\", \"frame\"}}} ``label`` служи на монтажници, които изискват име на сайт дори когато заместващото заглавие е изключено. ``bootstrap`` показва дали ролята свързва общата карта на компонента Bootstrap. Слот с ``frame`` комплектът е показан върху маркова хромирана, така че нейният текст взема рамката текстов цвят."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "A mapping whose keys are the declared container paths, ``{}`` when the image definitively declares none, and ``None`` when the answer is indeterminate."
msgstr "Картографиране, чиито ключове са обявените пътища на контейнера, ``{}`` когато изображението категорично не декларира нито едно, и ``None`` когато отговорът е неопределен."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A marker value MUST be a non-empty string. If the marker key is present but the value is of the wrong YAML type, empty, or whitespace- only, the role's typing is broken: :func:`get_role_types` raises :class:`RoleTypeError` so the misconfiguration surfaces at the first call instead of silently degrading to a different type."
msgstr "Маркерната стойност трябва да бъде непразен низ. Ако маркерният ключ е налице, но стойността е от грешен тип YAML, празен или бял - само, че написването на ролята е нарушено: :func:`get_role_types` увеличение :class:`RoleTypeError` Така че повърхните повърхности на първото обаждане, вместо мълчаливо да се унижават с различен тип."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A matching `SYSTEM_EMAIL_<KEY>` variable defined anywhere in Ansible variable scope (inventory, group vars, host vars)."
msgstr "Съвпадение `SYSTEM_EMAIL_<KEY>` променлива, определена някъде в обхвата на променливата Ansible (инвентаризация, група vars, приемаща vars)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A matrix round hands every role the round index, clamping to variant 0 when the role has fewer entries (:func:`services_overrides_for_round`). A pairing therefore holds only while two independently maintained variant lists happen to agree on an index, and it breaks silently the moment the partner has fewer variants than the round."
msgstr "Матрица кръгла ръце всяка роля кръг индекс, затягане към вариант 0 когато ролята има по-малко записи (:func:`services_overrides_for_round`). Двойка следователно държи само докато два самостоятелно поддържани вариант списъци се случват да се споразумеят за индекс, и той прекъсва мълчаливо в момента, в който партньорът има по-малко варианти от кръга."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A measured rate reaches `traits.speed`, and a declared one outranks it"
msgstr "Измерена скорост достига `traits.speed`, и обявен за по-старши"

msgid "A member of ``site-owner`` administers the site ``<username>.<parent>``, where ``domains.served`` in the Multisite variant sets the parent to ``user.blog.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>``. Only a Keycloak username (``[a-z1-9]``, or the agent form ``<4 chars>0<suffix>``) of at most 63 characters that is no WordPress ``illegal_names`` entry names a site. The mapper creates the site on the member’s first SSO login, records the member’s OIDC subject on it and only ever takes over or archives a site that carries that subject or that the deploy reserved for the login. An SSO login outside the group archives the site and keeps its content, a login back in the group restores it. A deploy applies a membership change as well: `tasks/05_site_owners.yml <tasks/05_site_owners.yml>`__ archives every own site whose login is no longer an inventory member and ends that member’s sessions."
msgstr ""

msgid "A member of `site-owner` administers the site `<username>.<parent>`, where `domains.served` in the Multisite variant sets the parent to `user.blog.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>`. Only a Keycloak username (`[a-z1-9]`, or the agent form `<4 chars>0<suffix>`) of at most 63 characters that is no WordPress `illegal_names` entry names a site. The mapper creates the site on the member's first SSO login, records the member's OIDC subject on it and only ever takes over or archives a site that carries that subject or that the deploy reserved for the login. An SSO login outside the group archives the site and keeps its content, a login back in the group restores it. A deploy applies a membership change as well: [tasks/05_site_owners.yml](tasks/05_site_owners.yml) archives every own site whose login is no longer an inventory member and ends that member's sessions."
msgstr ""

msgid "A mesh is IPv4 only, on the underlay as inside the tunnel. Each deploy resolves every endpoint a host dials with ``getent ahostsv4`` on that host, writes the first IPv4 address into ``Endpoint``, measures the path MTU against that address and subtracts the 60-byte IPv4 tunnel header. On an interface that is already up, the deploy sets that MTU on the live link as well. An endpoint name with both an A and an AAAA record therefore always dials over IPv4. A name without an A record, an unreachable resolver, an IPv6 literal endpoint or a host whose only IPv4 address is ``127.0.0.1`` fails the deploy before the interface is rendered; pass the peer’s IPv4 address as ``--endpoint`` instead. A host with an IPv4 address but no IPv4 route to the peer fails at the handshake gate. When the hub’s address changes, redeploy every spoke."
msgstr ""

msgid "A mesh is IPv4 only, on the underlay as inside the tunnel. Each deploy resolves every endpoint a host dials with `getent ahostsv4` on that host, writes the first IPv4 address into `Endpoint`, measures the path MTU against that address and subtracts the 60-byte IPv4 tunnel header. On an interface that is already up, the deploy sets that MTU on the live link as well. An endpoint name with both an A and an AAAA record therefore always dials over IPv4. A name without an A record, an unreachable resolver, an IPv6 literal endpoint or a host whose only IPv4 address is `127.0.0.1` fails the deploy before the interface is rendered; pass the peer's IPv4 address as `--endpoint` instead. A host with an IPv4 address but no IPv4 route to the peer fails at the handshake gate. When the hub's address changes, redeploy every spoke."
msgstr ""

msgid "A message is addressed to an agent account or a human username, never to a session name: a session comes and goes, but the account is the stable identity a reply must reach. This rejects a recipient that looks like a session id so a message is never bound to a transient session."
msgstr ""

