msgstr "Съобщение, подготвено за превод в HTML режим."

msgid "A message that is one technical token reads the same everywhere: an abbreviation in capitals, a version, or a run of command-line options."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A minted Tor v3 onion key and its ``HiddenServiceDir`` file contents."
msgstr "Подправено Tor v3 Лук и ключ ``HiddenServiceDir`` съдържанието на файла."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A missing event indicates a coverage regression in the deploy chain (typically: a once-flag swallowed an include before the role could run)."
msgstr "Липсващото събитие показва регресия на покритието във веригата на разполагане (Обикновено: веднъж-флаг погълнат включва преди ролята може да тече)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A missing secret resolves to an empty string in workflow expressions. The workflow run starts and proceeds normally until the token-minting step:"
msgstr "Липсващата тайна решава на празен низ с израз на работния поток. Работният поток започва и продължава нормално до стъпката на жетониране:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A model asked to place a translation on :data:`LEVELS`."
msgstr "Един модел поискал превод на :data:`LEVELS`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A model entry MAY still carry a `traits` mapping (`vision`, `tools`, `max_output`, `cost`), and it wins over the catalog. That is for what the catalog does not know: `openrouter/auto`, the mock, and a local tag such as `ollama/qwen2.5:0.5b` that is absent although its family is present. `context` keeps its existing home on the entry, feeds `AI_MODEL_CONTEXTS` and `num_ctx`, and outranks the catalogued window."
msgstr "Вход за модел МЕЙ все още носи `traits` Картиране (`vision`, `tools`, `max_output`, `cost`), И печели над каталога. Това е за това, което каталогът не знае: `openrouter/auto`, подигравка и местен етикет като `ollama/qwen2.5:0.5b` което отсъства, въпреки че семейството му присъства. `context` поддържа своя съществуващ дом на входа, храни `AI_MODEL_CONTEXTS` както и `num_ctx`, И превъзхожда каталогизирания прозорец."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A model is content-addressed and re-downloadable, so it belongs beside the package and registry caches rather than in a docker volume: a bind survives the runner, its volumes and an image rebuild, and every node keeps its own copy instead of dragging gigabytes across a shared filesystem."
msgstr "Моделът е със съдържание-адрес и re-downloadable, така че той принадлежи към пакета и регистър кешове, а не в docker обем: обвързване оцелява бегача, неговите обеми и изображение възстановяване, и всеки възел запазва свое копие, вместо да влачат гигабайти през споделена файлова система."

msgid "A model that already carries a rate is not measured at all. Re-measuring everything on every deploy would send traffic whose result the tolerance below discards anyway, and that traffic is the entire live surface of this step: it is what can hang, what can fail the deploy, and what the deploy waits for. `services.litellm.router.speed.remeasure` discards the stored numbers once, for the case where the hardware under them changed."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A model that already carries a rate sends no request, and the remeasure switch sends them again"
msgstr "Модел, който вече носи курс, не изпраща искане, и преизмерването ги изпраща отново"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A model that serves agents declares its context window in tokens: `context` on an `AI_LOCAL_MODELS` entry or on a `services.litellm.remote_models` entry. LiteLLM sends it to Ollama as `num_ctx` and publishes it as `model_info.max_input_tokens`, and the broker writes it into the agent config as Hermes `model.context_length` and OpenClaw `contextWindow`. Without it Ollama truncates the agent's prompt to its own default window and the agents assume windows of their own."
msgstr "Модел, който обслужва агенти декларира своя контекст прозорец в символи: `context` на `AI_LOCAL_MODELS` вписване или върху `services.litellm.remote_models` Вход. LitellM го изпраща на Ollama като `num_ctx` и го публикува като `model_info.max_input_tokens`, Брокерът го пише на агента като Хермес. `model.context_length` както и OpenClaw `contextWindow`. Без него. Ollama Проваля бързата процедура на агента до прозореца по подразбиране и агентите поемат своите прозорци."

msgid "A model vendor (`flavour: model-vendor`) also lists the agent `runtimes` it serves and its `login_hosts`. A workspace with `model_access: login` adds exactly these hosts to its egress, and only for a runtime the vendor names; in gateway mode they stay closed, and a deny rule of the agent's firewall role removes any of them in both modes; every egress target is compared lowercase and without a trailing dot, and L08 refuses any other spelling. Lint L08 accepts only exact login host names and refuses hosts that serve user content (`claude.ai`, `chatgpt.com`). Codex signed in with a ChatGPT account talks to `chatgpt.com`, which also serves the account's conversations and file uploads, so `openai.yml` does not list it: a login-mode Codex VM works only with an OpenAI API login until the proxy can admit a single path of that host."
