msgid "A term needs no answer when the front proxy reaches it (``proxy_pass`` goes over the overlay in swarm), when it renders only outside swarm, or when it feeds Discourse's ``expose:`` list. Every other one carries ``nocheck: swarm-loopback-port <category> <reason>``, where the category is ``exec`` (reached through container exec), ``overlay`` (reached by service name), ``netns`` (reached inside the service's network namespace), ``unused`` (nothing reaches it under swarm) or ``open`` (swarm does not reach it yet; the reason cites the open criterion that tracks the migration as ``NNN :LINE``, line ``LINE`` of ``docs/requirements/NNN-*.md``). A task-file marker that starts with ``file`` before its category covers the whole file and sits in the file's leading comment block."
