msgid "Opt-in live third-party checks, excluded from `make test`"
msgstr "Живи проверки на трети страни, изключени от `make test`"

msgid "Opt-in open subtrees of the role contract."
msgstr ""

msgid "Optimise the real cost first: per-item process spawning in loops (one process or round trip per item becomes one batched call, one script or one module; parallelise only independent idempotent calls), idempotency flip-flops (any `changed` on a second consecutive run), and image pulls (pre-pull only the references the host lacks, found through one image listing)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Optimise the real cost first: per-item process spawning in loops, idempotency flip-flops (a `changed` on a second consecutive run) and needless image pulls. Never trade error semantics, credential masking, concurrency correctness or lint intent for speed."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimised for Arch Linux, the role installs NGINX, prepares opinionated configuration snippets and exposes a simple interface for other roles to drop in new virtual-hosts."
msgstr "Оптимизиран за Arch Linux, ролята инсталира NGINX, подготвя situated конфигурация snipeds и излага прост интерфейс за други роли, за да падне в нови виртуални-хостове."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimised for Arch Linux, the role installs NGINX, prepares opinionated configuration snippets and exposes a simple interface for other roles to drop in new virtual-hosts.   It plays well with **Let’s Encrypt**, **OAuth2 Proxy**, and your existing Docker stack."
msgstr "Оптимизиран за Arch Linux, ролята инсталира NGINX, подготвя situated конфигурация snipeds и излага прост интерфейс за други роли, за да падне в нови виртуални-хостове. Играе добре с **Да шифроваме**, **OAuth2 Proxy**, и вашия съществуващ Docker стек."

