# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Runs [__main__.py](../../../../cli/contributing/network/diagnose/__main__.py) inside the running `infinito` container and produces a structured DNS / TCP / TLS / PMTU report against the standard infrastructure hosts (`github.com`, `ghcr.io`, `registry-1.docker.io`, `auth.docker.io`, `pypi.org`, `files.pythonhosted.org`, `registry.npmjs.org`, `objects.githubusercontent.com`, `raw.githubusercontent.com`), separately for IPv4 and IPv6 when available. Extra hosts can be appended via `INFINITO_NET_DEBUG_HOSTS=\"example.com api.example.org\" make diagnose-network`."
msgstr "Протича [ main .py](../../../../cli/contributing/network/diagnose/__main__.py) вътре в бягането `infinito` контейнер и произвежда структуриран DNS / TCP / TLS / PMTU доклад срещу стандартните инфраструктурни хостове (`github.com`, `ghcr.io`, `registry-1.docker.io`, `auth.docker.io`, `pypi.org`, `files.pythonhosted.org`, `registry.npmjs.org`, `objects.githubusercontent.com`, `raw.githubusercontent.com`), отделно за IPv4 и IPv6 когато е на разположение. Допълнителни хостове могат да бъдат приложени чрез `INFINITO_NET_DEBUG_HOSTS=\"example.com api.example.org\" make diagnose-network`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Runs `Stalwart <https://stalw.art/>`__ — a secure, all-in-one mail and collaboration server — as the platform’s email provider. A single hardened service speaks **SMTP, Submission, IMAP, POP3, JMAP, ManageSieve, CalDAV, CardDAV and WebDAV**, with a **built-in spam filter**, **DKIM/DMARC** signing and a **WebAdmin + REST management API**."
