# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role MUST follow the standard role-meta layout described in [layout.md](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) (`meta/services.yml`, `meta/secrets.yml`, `meta/volumes.yml`, `meta/variants.yml`, `meta/info.yml`, `meta/main.yml`). [web-app-openproject](../../roles/web-app-openproject/) is the closest structural model — it combines PostgreSQL, a Redis `cache` service, background workers, an internal proxy, Keycloak SSO and LDAP — and SHOULD be used as the primary reference; [web-app-taiga](../../roles/web-app-taiga/) and [web-app-confluence](../../roles/web-app-confluence/) are secondary references."
msgstr "Ролята ТРЯБВА да следва стандартното оформление на ролевата мета, описано в [layout.md](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) (`meta/services.yml`, `meta/secrets.yml`, `meta/volumes.yml`, `meta/variants.yml`, `meta/info.yml`, `meta/main.yml`). [web-app-openproject](../../roles/web-app-openproject/) е най-близкият структурен модел, който съчетава PostgreSQL, a Redis `cache` услуги, работници по миналото, вътрешен представител, Keycloak SSO и LDAP го използват като основна референтна стойност; [web-app-taiga](../../roles/web-app-taiga/) както и [web-app-confluence](../../roles/web-app-confluence/) са вторични препратки."

