msgid "The temporary account is the user ``keycloak_bootstrap`` in `users.yml <meta/users.yml>`__, username ``keycloakbootstrap``, with no accounts. It exists only in the master realm, where Keycloak creates it from ``KC_BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_USERNAME`` and ``KC_BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_PASSWORD``. The deploy creates no directory entry, realm user or mailbox for it, and the realm’s user profile reserves its username."
msgstr ""

