# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role configures an [NGINX](https://NGINX.org/) server to host a static HTML homepage securely over HTTPS. It automates domain configuration, SSL/TLS certificate retrieval using [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/), and ensures your site is ready for production with minimal setup."
msgstr "Тази роля конфигурира [NGINX](https://NGINX.org/) сървър за хоста на статичен HTML начална страница сигурно над HTPS. Автоматизира конфигурацията на домейна, SSL/TLS сертификат за извличане, използвайки [Да шифроваме.](https://letsencrypt.org/), и гарантира, че вашият сайт е готов за производство с минимална настройка."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role configures an `NGINX <https://NGINX.org/>`__ server to host a static HTML homepage securely over HTTPS. It automates domain configuration, SSL/TLS certificate retrieval using `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__, and ensures your site is ready for production with minimal setup."
msgstr "Тази роля конфигурира `NGINX <https://NGINX.org/>`__ сървър за хоста на статичен HTML начална страница сигурно над HTPS. Автоматизира конфигурацията на домейна, SSL/TLS сертификат за извличане, използвайки `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__, и гарантира, че вашият сайт е готов за производство с минимална настройка."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role core role for Nginx HTML injection of Matomo, theming, iFrame and JS snippets based on application feature flags."
msgstr "Тази роля основна роля за Nginx HTML инжектиране на Matomo, Темпинг, iFrame и JS snippets въз основа на приложение функции знамена."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role create Cloudflare wildcard DNS records (*.parent) for parent hosts; no base or*.apex records."
msgstr "Тази роля създава Cloudflare Wildcard DNS записи (*..родител) за приемници майки; няма база или*Апекс рекорди."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates a dedicated administrator user for local administrative tasks. The administrator account is configured to require a password when executing [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo), ensuring secure privilege escalation. For security reasons, it is recommended to use this dedicated administrator user instead of the default root account."
msgstr "Тази роля създава специален администратор за местни административни задачи. Сметката на администратора е конфигурирана да изисква парола при изпълнение [Судо](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo), осигуряване на сигурна ескалация на привилегиите. От съображения за сигурност се препоръчва да използвате този специален администратор вместо кореновата сметка по подразбиране."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates a dedicated administrator user for local administrative tasks. The administrator account is configured to require a password when executing `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__, ensuring secure privilege escalation. For security reasons, it is recommended to use this dedicated administrator user instead of the default root account."
msgstr "Тази роля създава специален администратор за местни административни задачи. Сметката на администратора е конфигурирана да изисква парола при изпълнение `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__, осигуряване на сигурна ескалация на привилегиите. От съображения за сигурност се препоръчва да използвате този специален администратор вместо кореновата сметка по подразбиране."

msgid "This role creates a flexible directory layout for managing Docker Compose projects across environments. It ensures directories are initialized, optionally reset, and kept clean using internal flags like `RESET` or `CLEANUP`."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role creates a flexible directory layout for managing Docker Compose projects across environments. It ensures directories are initialized, optionally reset, and kept clean using internal flags like ``RESET`` or ``CLEANUP``."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role creates nothing under a consumer's names. [test_consumer_namespaces.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/erpnext/test_consumer_namespaces.py) holds every reserved prefix and name and fails when one appears anywhere in this role."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role creates nothing under a consumer’s names. `test_consumer_namespaces.py <../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/erpnext/test_consumer_namespaces.py>`__ holds every reserved prefix and name and fails when one appears anywhere in this role."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates the workstation user defined by *WORKSTATION_USER* and configures its basic environment. It integrates with the shared ``user`` role to deploy shell dotfiles and SSH ``authorized_keys``."
msgstr "Тази роля създава потребителя на работната станция, определен от *WORKSTATION_USER* и конфигурира основната си среда. Той се интегрира с споделените ``user`` роля за разполагането на дотфайлове на корпуса и SSH ``authorized_keys``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates the workstation user defined by *WORKSTATION_USER* and configures its basic environment. It integrates with the shared `user` role to deploy shell dotfiles and SSH `authorized_keys`."
msgstr "Тази роля създава потребителя на работната станция, определен от *WORKSTATION_USER* и конфигурира основната си среда. Той се интегрира с споделените `user` роля за разполагането на дотфайлове на корпуса и SSH `authorized_keys`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates the workstation user selected via WORKSTATION_USER and configures the user environment."
msgstr "Тази роля създава потребителя на работната станция избран чрез WORKSTATION_USER и конфигурира потребителската среда."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for the same mechanism. Mattermost Team Edition ships no native OIDC provider, so the role piggybacks Keycloak onto the GitLab OAuth slot (`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*` in `templates/env.j2`); the resulting entry point is `a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']`, relabelled \"SSO with Infinito.Nexus\" by `templates/javascript.js.j2`, which the shared helper's name-based login matcher does not recognise. Mattermost v11+ also serves a `/landing` interstitial to unauthenticated visitors that only clears once `localStorage.__landingPageSeen__` is seeded before navigation, and the shared helper has no init-script hook to do that."
msgstr "Тази роля декларира `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` както и `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` в `templates/playwright.env.j2` за същия механизъм. Най-важният Team Edition кораби не родния доставчик OIDC, така че ролята piggybacks Keycloak върху GitLab OAuth слот (`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*` в `templates/env.j2`); полученият входен пункт е `a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']`, премаркиран \"SSO с Infinito.Nexus\" от `templates/javascript.js.j2`, който споделеният помощник-базиран на име логин мач не разпознава. Най-важното v11+ също служи `/landing` Интерстициален към неавтентирани посетители, които се изчистват само веднъж `localStorage.__landingPageSeen__` е засята преди навигацията, и споделеният помощник няма кука init-script да направи това."

msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for two different reasons. The MinIO Console version pinned here never renders an SSO button — `/api/v1/login` answers `redirectRules: null` however the identity provider is registered server-side — so there is no in-page OIDC entry point for the shared helper to click. Biber is blocked because MinIO policies exist only for the RBAC group paths (`MINIO_RBAC_POLICIES` in `vars/main.yml`) and MinIO has no self-service signup, so biber without one of those groups maps to no policy and has no authenticated surface at either tier."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Both personas are blocked by `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableAutoLogin`, which this role sets to true in `vars/main.yml`: every anonymous request is bounced straight back into the identity provider, so the verified unauthenticated landing after in-app logout that the persona contract demands can never be observed here. The path back to the generic personas is auto-login off."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Keycloak provides SSO rather than consuming it: `meta/services.yml` carries no `sso` block (the `keycloak` service declares `provides: sso`) and pins `logout.enabled: false`, so the canonical URL has neither an oauth2-proxy gate nor an in-app OIDC login link for the shared persona helpers to click or log out of. The administrator persona is additionally out of reach because Keycloak's only admin surface is the master-realm console, which accepts the permanent super-admin account (`KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_PASSWORD` in `vars/main.yml`) under its own login name and not the normal-realm one the helper types."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Mailu's OIDC fork interposes its own `/sso/login` page that carries a local login form next to an `openid-connect/auth` link, while the authenticated Roundcube surface carries an `openid-connect/logout` link; the shared helper matches login controls by accessible name and cannot tell the two apart, so it clicks logout. The administrator persona is blocked for a second, independent reason: Mailu's admin surface is a separate Flask app mounted at `WEB_ADMIN=/admin` (`templates/env.j2`), not the `/webmail/` surface the OIDC callback lands on."
msgstr "Тази роля декларира `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` както и `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` в `templates/playwright.env.j2`. OIDC вилица Meleu се намесва своя собствена `/sso/login` страница, която носи местна форма за влизане до `openid-connect/auth` връзка, докато автентичната повърхност Rundcube носи `openid-connect/logout` връзка; споделен помощник мачове вход контроли с достъпно име и не може да се каже на двете отделно, така че кликва на изход. Администраторът persona е блокиран за втора, независима причина: Mailu на администратор повърхността е отделно Flask приложение монтирани в `WEB_ADMIN=/admin` (`templates/env.j2`), не на `/webmail/` повърхността на OIDC обратно кацане на."

msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Moodle's site administrator is created by `install_database.php` in `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` and realigned on every pass, both from the `platform_administrator` user, so the native form and the identity provider carry one secret. In the SSO variant `tasks/05_login_methods.yml` sets `alternateloginurl` so `/login/index.php` bounces to the OIDC plugin and `tasks/04_oidc.yml` rewrites every `mdl_user` row to `auth='oidc'`, so no form accepts either secret; the SSO-off variants in `meta/variants.yml` have no OIDC chain to substitute. One env file is rendered per role, not per variant, so the flag has to hold for the worst case."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. KIX sits behind an oauth2-proxy whose `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` in `meta/services.yml` admits only `roles/web-app-kix/administrator` and `roles/web-app-kix/user`; biber belongs to neither, so the proxy denies him before KIX renders anything. Past the proxy KIX is a two-stage login: the SPA still presents its own agent form at `/auth` that binds against LDAP, and the shared persona helper has no second stage after the Keycloak round-trip."
msgstr ""

# както и ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` в ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` за същия
# механизъм. Най-важният Team Edition кораби не родния доставчик OIDC, така че
# ролята piggybacks Keycloak върху GitLab OAuth слот (``MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*``
# в ``templates/env.j2``); полученият входен пункт е
# ``a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']``, повторно облицовани годеж с
# Infinito.NexusПревод и субтитри: ``templates/javascript.js.j2``, които
# споделената помощ е името-базирани логин мача не признава. Най-важното v11+
# също служи ``/landing`` Интерстициален към неавтентирани посетители, които
