msgid "With `services.translate.enabled`, `templates/LocalSettings.php.j2` loads `MachineTranslation` in its own block and sets `$wgMachineTranslationServiceConfig` to `MEDIAWIKI_TRANSLATE_SERVICE_CONFIG`: `type` is `LibreTranslate` and `url` is `MEDIAWIKI_TRANSLATE_URL`, the container-network endpoint `http://<translate service name>:<internal port>` resolved from `web-svc-translate`. The gateway speaks LibreTranslate's shapes, so the extension's own `/languages` and `/translate` suffixes reach it unchanged, and it routes onward to whichever backend serves the pair. Leaving the global unset ships the value from the extension's own `extension.json`, `https://trans.zillyhuhn.com`, and every page the extension translates goes to that third-party host."
