msgid "[atmo.rsvp](https://atmo.rsvp) is an open-source event platform built on the AT Protocol. An event is a `community.lexicon.calendar.event` record and an RSVP is a `community.lexicon.calendar.rsvp` record, both stored in the repository of the user's own Personal Data Server (PDS). The atmo app is an appview over those records, so events and RSVPs stay portable across every app of the open social web."
