msgid "[x] Role placement is read from the role's primary `meta/services.yml` entry, and only that entry drives the volume derivation above. A `placement` on any other service entry pins that one service and nothing else: it leaves the role unpinned, so the role's volumes stay NFS-backed and every volume the pinned service owns MUST carry its own `nfs: false`. `web-app-gitlab` (`gitaly`) and `svc-cache-package` (`frontend`) are the roles that use this form."
