msgid "[x] [web-svc-cdn](../../roles/web-svc-cdn/), [web-svc-simpleicons](../../roles/web-svc-simpleicons/), [web-svc-libretranslate](../../roles/web-svc-libretranslate/): services with no end-user UI session. None declares `BIBER_USERNAME` / `BIBER_PASSWORD`; cdn and simpleicons collapse their biber stub, libretranslate opts out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`."
