# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` seed a break-glass local admin (dedicated `breakglass` login + dedicated email, no collision with the SSO/LDAP identities) in **every** variant; no setup wizard is presented on first load. Its form login is reachable only when LDAP is disabled (Semaphore forces LDAP-only form auth otherwise)."
