msgid "[x] `compute_external_network_roles` skips relay attachments (`utils/networks/render.py:142`), so `compose_external_networks` of openresty, openldap and every LDAP client is equal with the switch on and off (`TestTheRelayIsNoRoleNetwork`, `test_the_switch_leaves_the_pre_created_role_overlays_unchanged`)."
