msgid "`$wgServer` is the origin of the network sibling the request host names, read with `WebRequest::detectServer()` and looked up in a map rendered from `lookup('network_siblings', …)` with each sibling's `lookup('tls', …, 'url.base')`. A host outside that map, a spoofed `Host` header or a maintenance script without one, gets `$wgCanonicalServer`, the canonical URL that e-mails, feeds and the print footer use."
