# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MM_EXPERIMENTALSETTINGS_DISABLELANDINGPAGE` in `templates/env.j2` does not switch the landing page off: the deployed 11.11.1 still hands `EnableDesktopLandingPage: \"true\"` to its client (measured through `/api/v4/config/client` on the compose stack), so a first visit lands on `/landing` and the specs seed `localStorage.__landingPageSeen__`. Options: set `MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLEDESKTOPLANDINGPAGE=false`; or keep the page and drop the dead variable."
msgstr "`MM_EXPERIMENTALSETTINGS_DISABLELANDINGPAGE` в `templates/env.j2` не изключва страницата за кацане: разгърнатата 11.11.1 Неподвижни ръце `EnableDesktopLandingPage: \"true\"` към своя клиент (измерена през `/api/v4/config/client` върху композиционния стек), така че първото посещение се приземи на `/landing` и спецификациите на семената `localStorage.__landingPageSeen__`. Опции: комплект `MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLEDESKTOPLANDINGPAGE=false`; или запази страницата и пусни мъртвата променлива."

msgid "`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*` (the Keycloak entry in the GitLab slot), the Keycloak mappers of `tasks/02_keycloak.yml` and the conversion of the administrator to GitLab auth in `tasks/03_oidc_admin.yml`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLEMULTIFACTORAUTHENTICATION`, offered to email accounts. `login.method.2fa.enforced` only offers it here: `ServiceSettings.EnforceMultifactorAuthentication` is reported without effect on the Team Edition this role installs, so the role does not render it"
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MOODLE_PROXY_EXCLUDED_HOSTS` feeds `no_proxy` and carries `lookup('proxy_excluded_hosts')` (loopback and the object store), `MOODLE_MCP_SERVICE_KEY` and, when the `litellm` service is on, the gateway host. The MCP entry is the `nginx` sidecar that `tasks/utils/mcp/verify.yml` probes with the `curl` binary from inside the container: `plugins/filter/curl.py` emits no `--noproxy`, `container exec` inherits the container environment, and Tor cannot resolve a Docker service name, so without the exemption that probe exhausts its retries and fails the deploy. Clearnet hosts such as the update checker's are deliberately left out, so they travel through Tor like the rest of the node's egress."
msgstr "`MOODLE_PROXY_EXCLUDED_HOSTS` фуражи `no_proxy` и носи `lookup('proxy_excluded_hosts')` (обратна връзка и обект магазин), `MOODLE_MCP_SERVICE_KEY` и когато `litellm` Обслужването е включено, домакинът на портала. Входът на MCP е `nginx` sidelcar that `tasks/utils/mcp/verify.yml` проби с `curl` двоично от вътрешността на контейнера: `plugins/filter/curl.py` не `--noproxy`, `container exec` наследява околната среда на контейнера, и Tor не може да реши име Docker услуга, така че без изключението, че сондата изтощава своите retrites и не успее разполагането. Домакините на Клиърнет, като тези на контрольора, са умишлено изоставени, така че пътуват през Тор като останалата част от изхода на възела."

msgid "`Mailu-OIDC 2024.06.18 (floating: ``2024.06``) <https://github.com/heviat/Mailu-OIDC/blob/2024.06.18/core/admin/mailu/oidc.py#L236-L261>`__ (closest tag to the floating ``2024.06`` image), `route <https://github.com/heviat/Mailu-OIDC/blob/2024.06.18/core/admin/mailu/sso/views/base.py#L161-L168>`__, `Roundcube session <https://github.com/heviat/Mailu-OIDC/blob/2024.06.18/webmails/roundcube/config/config.inc.php#L17>`__"
