msgid "``$wgServer`` is the origin of the network sibling the request host names, read with ``WebRequest::detectServer()`` and looked up in a map rendered from ``lookup('network_siblings', …)`` with each sibling’s ``lookup('tls', …, 'url.base')``. A host outside that map, a spoofed ``Host`` header or a maintenance script without one, gets ``$wgCanonicalServer``, the canonical URL that e-mails, feeds and the print footer use."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format
msgid "``%%`` is \"contains\" for a scalar string value and \"is a member of\" for a set value; ``==`` / ``!=`` against a set mean membership / non-membership. String comparisons (``==`` ``!=`` ``%%``) are case-insensitive; ``< > <= >=`` are numeric. A bare expression with no operator (e.g. ``nextcloud``) is shorthand for ``name %% nextcloud``."
msgstr "``%%`` е \"contains\" за скаларна низова стойност и \"е член на\" за зададена стойност; ``==`` / ``!=`` срещу набор означава членство / нечленство. Сравнение на низовете (``==`` ``!=`` ``%%``) са чувствителни към случаи; ``< > <= >=`` са цифрови. Гол израз без оператор (напр. ``nextcloud``) е стенография за ``name %% nextcloud``."

