msgid "``ansible`` (default)"
msgstr "``ansible`` (по подразбиране)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``ansible`` (default) wraps `matrix-docker-ansible-deploy <https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy>`__ (MDAD). MDAD runs ~70 upstream sub-roles to deliver Synapse, Element, every supported bridge, Element Call, and Jitsi. Infinito.Nexus pins MDAD by commit, renders an MDAD inventory from ``services.matrix.*`` knobs, and disables MDAD’s bundled Traefik / Postgres / Redis so the central Infinito services back the stack."
msgstr "``ansible`` (по подразбиране) опаковки `matrix-docker-ansible-deploy <https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy>`__ (MDAD). MDAD бяга70 Подрелси нагоре по веригата, за да доставят Synapse, Element, всеки поддържан мост, Element Call, и Jitsi. Infinito.Nexus пинове MDAD чрез обвързване, прави MDAD инвентар от ``services.matrix.*`` Копчета, и деактивира MDAD... Redis Така че централната Infinito услуги назад стека."

