msgstr "``mcp`` декларира повърхността на протокола за модела GitLab служи от своя Rails API."

msgid "``measure(roles, variants)``. ``roles`` is a closure a resolver already settled, so no dependency is walked and a provider counts only when it is listed. ``variants`` is the round's per-app variant index, as in required_storage_bytes. The result maps each role to its declared bytes, 0 for a role that declares nothing or is no application."
msgstr ""

msgid "``memory`` and ``disk`` sizes the host keeps for itself."
