msgid "``meta/services.yml`` cannot answer this. It mixes the role's own services with the shared ones it merely consumes, and the entries that do describe a container disagree about which fields they carry: some name the container, some only the image, some neither because the image is built. No field is a reliable discriminator, so a heuristic over that file silently drops real containers."
