msgid "`make i18n-translate` never revisits a filled entry, so the translator judges finished entries in a separate pass (`make test-oracle`) inside the window. The pass samples a fixed number of entries per language, so its cost grows with the number of languages, never with catalog size; it shares the model instance with the translation and is budgeted at about one hour of the window."
