msgid "`make i18n-translate` reaches its engines through the gateway of [040 - Translation Gateway](040-translation-gateway.md) rather than one engine directly, and brings up that gateway's bundle the way it used to bring up the lone engine. The boundary the two requirements first drew between build time and request time is recorded as re-opened in 040, with the catalog measurement that overturned it."
msgstr "`make i18n-translate` достига двигателите си през портала на [040 - Translation Gateway](040-translation-gateway.md) вместо един двигател директно, и повдига снопа на този портал по начина, по който го е използвал, за да повдигне самотния двигател. Границата, която двете изисквания първо начертаха между времето за изграждане и времето за заявка, се записва като отворена отново в 040, с каталожните измервания, които го преобърнаха."

msgid "`make infra-up` creates, once per machine, the network `infinito-infra` (proposed name) on a fixed subnet outside `172.30.0.0/16`, and the privileged runner container of the compose project `infinito-infra`. It renders `inventories/development/infra.yml.j2` (replacing [tools.yml.j2](../../inventories/development/tools.yml.j2)) to `~/inventories/infinito-infra` (D21), deploys the cache roles into the runner, and runs `make cache-evict`. It holds a machine-wide lock, so two concurrent calls start one runner, and a call against a running runner with unchanged inputs changes nothing."
