msgid "`make infra-update` redeploys the roles from the invoking checkout, for a changed role or a changed cap. `make infra-down` stops the runner and keeps every byte under `/var/cache/infinito`. `make infra-status` reports the runner state, the deployed roles, the pool and `make cache-status`."
