# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`svc-dns-unbound` is a single-service, single-network, static-IP, pinned role. mailu's services drop their own unbound + static IP, attach to the `svc-dns-unbound` network, and point `dns:` at its static IP. The static-IP allocation therefore lives in a trivial 1-service stack (no deadlock) instead of mailu's 13-service / 4-network stack. mailu also stops embedding redis (uses central) -> fewer services -> less VIP pressure."
msgstr "`svc-dns-unbound` е единна услуга, единна мрежа, статичен РП, ограничена роля. Услугите на mailu пускат свой собствен несвързан + статичен IP, прикрепен към `svc-dns-unbound` мрежа и точка `dns:` при статично IP. Следователно разпределението на статичен РП живее в тривиално 1- сервизен стек (Няма задънена улица.) вместо на поща. 13- услуга / 4- Мрежова купчина. mailu също спира вграждането redis (използване на централен) -> по-малко услуги - > по-малко ВИП налягане."

msgid "`svc-net-wireguard.networks.meshes` declares the meshes. It belongs in the hub's `host_vars`, which is where the mesh CLI reads it."
msgstr ""

msgid "`svc-net-wireguard` names mesh peers by inventory hostname. `cli.administration.inventory.mesh` writes each host's mesh address, keys and peers into that host's `host_vars` in one pass over every inventory, and `lookup('mesh_address', <host>)` returns a host's primary mesh address, IPv4 only."
msgstr ""

msgid "`svc-registry-cache` gains the flavor key (proposed `cache.flavor`, beside the existing `cache.healthcheck.flavor`): `registry` keeps today's rendering for servers, `multi-proxy` renders the proxy the dev stack runs today with its CA, for every registry in `INFINITO_CACHE_REGISTRIES` (D9)."
msgstr ""

msgid "`svc-registry-cache` gets a selectable flavor, `registry` or `multi-proxy`. The infra inventory uses `multi-proxy` (`rpardini/docker-registry-proxy`); server inventories keep `registry`, unchanged."
msgstr ""

msgid "`svc-runner` gains the flavor key (proposed `runner.flavor`): `github` keeps today's behaviour, `local` registers nowhere, needs no PAT, takes jobs from the local queue, mounts the worktree roots at their host paths instead of checking out `RUNNER_GIT_REF`, and keeps the per-instance DinD environment of [runner_instance_env.j2](../../roles/svc-runner/templates/runner_instance_env.j2) (unique project, prefix, subnet and volume), with the cache addresses pointing at the shared caches of the infra runner."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`svc-virt-kata/tasks/00_core.yml` reads `container info --format DefaultRuntime` and refuses `runc` **before** labelling the node, so the label never promises what the node cannot deliver"
msgstr "`svc-virt-kata/tasks/00_core.yml` чете `container info --format DefaultRuntime` и отказва `runc` **преди** етикетиране на възела, така че етикетът никога не обещава това, което възелът не може да достави"

msgid "`svc-virt-kata/tasks/utils/assert/isolated.yml` reads `HostConfig.Runtime` off the running container and refuses `runc`"
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`synapse-usage-exporter` turns Synapse's metrics listener on and publishes it on the `matrix-mdad` container's own interface. The outer Prometheus joins this role's docker network and scrapes the DiD container by name, which is why `services.prometheus.native_metrics` resolves its `service_key` and `port` per flavor: `synapse:9000` for the in-repo compose stack, `matrix:9100` for the MDAD stack where the homeserver runs one docker layer deeper."
msgstr "`synapse-usage-exporter` включва метричния слушател на Synapse и го публикува на `matrix-mdad` собствен интерфейс на контейнера. Външният Prometheus се присъединява към докерската мрежа на тази роля и изстъргва DID контейнера по име, поради което `services.prometheus.native_metrics` решава `service_key` както и `port` на вкус: `synapse:9000` за композиционния пакет in-repo, `matrix:9100` за MDAD стека, където хоумсървърът работи един докер слой по-дълбоко."

